# Family Tree — Agent Context

Full wiki: `docs/AGENT_WIKI.md` · Quick guide: `AGENTS.md`

## Stack
Zero-build SPA: `index.html` + ES modules in `js/`. D3 v7 graph, Tailwind CDN, Lucide icons, Hebrew RTL. Data from Google Apps Script (`API_URL` in `js/config.js`).

## Edit map
- Layout/render: `js/graph.js`
- Cloud I/O: `js/api.js`
- Modals/cards: `js/ui.js` + `index.html`
- Events/CRUD: `js/app.js`
- State/demo: `js/config.js`

## Rules
- Call `updateGraphView()` after mutating `globalState.familyData`
- Use `?.` for DOM listeners (see `app.js`)
- Do not add npm/build unless asked
- Layout is `calculateDeterministicGrid()` — do not switch to force layout
- New user strings: Hebrew

## Known gaps (HTML missing in index.html)
`settings-menu-modal`, `confirm-modal`, `toast-notification` — settings, delete confirm, and toasts are broken until added.

## Admin
Passcode `"Eilon"` in `app.js` sets `globalState.isAdmin = true`.
